<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal sets rules for itemised phone billing.</title>
<headline>Portugal sets rules for itemised phone billing.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Portuguese government has approved a decree establishing rules for the itemised billing of residential customers of Portugal Telecom without charge and upon the request of the customer, PT said.</p>
<p>&quot;The decree directs that the itemised service be provided taking into account the current and future technological development of the company,&quot; a statement said.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
